l Security is never taxed in South Carolina at any income, and retirement deductions here have no income test. Military retirement is fully exempt, owner-occupied property tax is among the lowest in the country, and there is no estate or inheritance tax. Then the ocean stays warm enough to swim into October."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why are investors buying in Myrtle Beach?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Millions of visitors a year rent somewhere to sleep, and oceanfront condos sell at prices northern buyers compare with parking spaces back home. Our Airbnb income page carries the real revenue ranges from five data vendors, and the building directory shows which buildings finance."}}]}</script>
